### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8787
@exampleNodeId = 9b275ab576eeba3c6677984be15ee22a74e54fdfe8e5ea700e84a03178dc4ac1

### OpenAPI Documentation
GET {{host}}/

### --- Forecourts ---

### List all forecourts (defaults)
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts

### List forecourts - with pagination
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?page=0&limit=10

### List forecourts - filter by brand
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?brand=Shell

### List forecourts - filter by postcode prefix
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?postcode=SW1

### List forecourts - filter by fuel type
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?fuel_type=E10

### List forecourts - geo bounding box (central London area)
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?sw_lat=51.48&sw_lng=-0.18&ne_lat=51.54&ne_lng=-0.07

### List forecourts - include closed stations
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?include_closed=true

### List forecourts - fuel type + geo bounding box
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?fuel_type=E10&sw_lat=51.48&sw_lng=-0.18&ne_lat=51.54&ne_lng=-0.07

### List forecourts - combined filters
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts?brand=Shell&fuel_type=E10&postcode=SW1&page=0&limit=20

### Get a single forecourt by node ID
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts/{{exampleNodeId}}

### --- Prices ---

### List current fuel prices (defaults, sorted cheapest first)
GET {{host}}/api/prices

### List prices - filter by fuel type
GET {{host}}/api/prices?fuel_type=E10

### List prices - filter by brand, sorted most expensive first
GET {{host}}/api/prices?brand=Shell&sort=price_desc

### List prices - filter by postcode prefix
GET {{host}}/api/prices?postcode=LE11

### List prices - paginated
GET {{host}}/api/prices?page=0&limit=10&fuel_type=B7_STANDARD

### --- Price History ---

### Get full price history for a forecourt
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts/{{exampleNodeId}}/prices/history

### Get price history - filtered by fuel type
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts/{{exampleNodeId}}/prices/history?fuel_type=E10

### Get price history - since a specific date
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts/{{exampleNodeId}}/prices/history?since=2026-01-01

### Get price history - combined filters with limit
GET {{host}}/api/forecourts/{{exampleNodeId}}/prices/history?fuel_type=E10&since=2026-01-01&limit=100

### --- Reference ---

### List available fuel types
GET {{host}}/api/fuel-types
